        "original_id": "b808f1da-38ce-5cf4-91c7-0761fa8b5528",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Ming-Na Wen, Joey Slotnick, Ernest Borgnine, Jonathan Silverman\n- TV series: The Single Guy\n- Roles: Sam Sloan, Trudy, Manny, Eliot's best friend, Sam's wife, doorman\n\nFacts:\n- Ming-Na Wen was born on November 20, 1963.\n- Ming-Na Wen is an American actress.\n- The TV series The Single Guy starred Jonathan Silverman as Eliot.\n- Joey Slotnick starred in The Single Guy as Eliot's best friend Sam Sloan throughout the series' entire run.\n- Ming-Na Wen starred in The Single Guy as Sam's wife Trudy throughout the series' entire run.\n- Ernest Borgnine starred in The Single Guy as doorman Manny throughout the series' entire run.",
